property_value: origindescription "Type of water buffalo. The indigenous breed buffaloes in the coastal area of southern part are mainly crossbred type. Crossbreeding of the indigenous breed buffaloes in the southern part started in 1960 with Nili-Ravi imported from Pakistan and subsequently produced in the Govt. Buffalo Breeding Farm at Khulna. This program is still going on." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

