property_value: origindescription "Red and White cattle predominated in the European cattle population until the 17th century. It was imported to Lower Silesia and the Opole region in the 19th century. It is widely distributed in the mountainous and submountainous regions." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

