property_value: origindescription "Bos taurus short horn, humpless, small breed of Tibetan and Mongolia.The origin of goleng is from the place of domestication along the silk road to Tibet and Mongolia.They came in ancient times over the highest Himalayan ridges to the southern slopes of Bhutan but remained at high altitude areas particularly found in Merak sakten dungkhags." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

