property_value: origindescription "The game chicken is an old native breed with a long history of more than two thousand years. The relevant records could be found in √¢‚Ç¨≈ìthe historical records√¢‚Ç¨¬ù. Wanbei game chicken had became popular in the Three Kingdoms Period, and more prevailing during Ming and Qing dynasty. The locals prefer to select aggressive individuals with fine fighting skills. The breed is formed after a long term of artificial selection and improvement." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

