property_value: dcterms:source "https://www.fao.org/dad-is" xsd:anyURI
property_value: origindescription "indigenous breed. Poland's have been painted very frequently in the past few centuries. The first known paintings in the Netherlands date back to the 16th century. Painters kept Poland's (and other old breeds) which then featured on different paintings! This proves again that Poland's are a very old breed and are part of our cultural history. To put it differently; to save the Poland as a breed is as important as keeping the paintings of the old masters in our museums!" xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

