property_value: hasdomesticationstatus VBO:0300006 {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}
property_value: origindescription "The camels brought into Australia were almost exclusively the one-humped camels (Camelus dromedarius) which are found in hot desert areas and are highly suited to the climate in Australia." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

