property_value: origindescription "Indigenous breed descended from primitive geese from the north-eastern Poland (the Bilgoraj region). Geese were bought from local farmers from Bilgoraj village in 1971 and 1973. The flock was supplemented with Bilgorajska geese from a liquidated farm RZD in Uhrusk. The flock has been kept as a closed population since 1971." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

