[Term]
id: VBO:0010423
name: obsolete Bavarian, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland (Horse)
comment: The concept of “breed reported in geographic location by FAO National Coordinators” is unique to DAD-IS (https://www.fao.org/dad-is/en/). This VBO term should therefore be used specifically for the breed conforming to this concept. Bavarian Warmblood, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland (Horse) and Bavarian United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland (Horse) represent the same concept in DAD-IS. DAD-IS refers to Bavarian Warmblood as the most common name.
