is_a: VBO:0400000 {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4142-7153", source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5002-8648"} ! Vertebrate breed
relationship: VBO:0300020 http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q215 {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"} ! breed reported in geographic location
