property_value: origindescription "In 2012 the UK published its second Country Report for FAnGR √¢‚Ç¨‚Äú the report included an updated breed inventory. During the inventory exercise the Welsh Mountain (Section A semi feral and Welsh Mountain Pony (Section A) were identified. Subsequent clarifications with a UK expert for this breed confirmed that these two breeds are the same. From 2012 onwards further information on this breed will be provided in the EFABIS record for Welsh (Feral Section)." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

