property_value: hasdomesticationstatus VBO:0300007 {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}
property_value: origindescription "The government started a horse improvement campaign at the beginning of this century. As a part of this campaign Thoroughbred or Arab stallions were bred with local mares to the detriment of the local breeds. By the 50's and 60's most Sudanese horses were carrying some English or Arab horse blood." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

