property_value: origindescription "imported from United Kingdom. This pig breed was created in England in the 19th century. As a result of a long lasting breeding work, influence of the climate and feeding, the English Great White pig type was radically changed, and now it is actually a domestic Great white breed which exceeds the European type by many characteristics." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

