property_value: origindescription "The breed was developed at the Popielno Experimental Station of the Polish Academy of Sciences. Research on the creation of the breed was initiated and supervised by Prof. Kaminski. The starting point was crossing Polish White rabbits with Belgian Giant White rabbits. The work on the Popielno White rabbit was continued by Dr Karlowicz. The pattern of the breed was approved in the middle of the 80-ties." xsd:string {source="https://www.fao.org/dad-is"}

