[Term]
id: VBO:0100262
name: Mixed Breed (Cat)
def: "A cat that is known or appears to be a mixture of two or more recognised breeds." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7356-1779]
