[Term]
id: VBO:0201489
name: Random-Bred Cat (Cat)
def: "A cat that has no known or obvious ancestry from a recognized breed." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9178-3965]
comment: Most randombred cats represent an intermediate step in cat domestication, between wildcats and recognised cat breeds. They are common in both rural and urban environments and are represented by generally feral street, barn, alley, house, community cats, moggies and various other names. Having no known or obvious breed ancestry distinguishes them from mixed breed cats which, as the name implies, are animals that are known or appear to be a mixture of two or more breeds. When entered in electronic medical records, random-bred cats are often named as domestic shorthair or domestic longhair, sometimes with a prefix, e.g. Japanese domestic shorthair, European domestic shorthair, or American domestic shorthair. https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1628-7726
synonym: "Companion Cat" EXACT [] {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597", source="https://cfa.org/breeds/", source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9178-3965"}
synonym: "Domestic Cat" EXACT [] {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597", source="https://www.aspcapetinsurance.com/resources/mixed-breed-cat/", source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9178-3965"}
synonym: "Domestic cat (hair length unspecified)" EXACT [] {source="https://venomcoding.org/venom-codes/"}
synonym: "House Cat" EXACT [] {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597", source="https://www.aspcapetinsurance.com/resources/mixed-breed-cat/", source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9178-3965"}
synonym: "Household Pet" EXACT [] {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597", source="https://cfa.org/showing-a-household-pet/", source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9178-3965", source="https://www.tica.org/breeds/browse-all-breeds"}
synonym: "Household Pet Kitten" EXACT [] {source="https://www.tica.org/phocadownload/hh.pdf"}
synonym: "Moggie" EXACT [] {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5520-6597", source="https://www.aspcapetinsurance.com/resources/mixed-breed-cat/", source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9178-3965"}
synonym: "Random-Bred Cat" EXACT most_common_name [] {source="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1628-7726"}
xref: VeNom:18747 {source="https://venomcoding.org/venom-codes/"}
